Q("The attachment economy is governed by:", ["Banning attachments", "Sizing — the settings limit, document-resolution scans, and the largest-files read when a jump appears", "Deleting evidence", "More disk only"], 1, "Evidence habits are the programme's own doing.", "Ch6"),
